# `html_extra_path` in conf.py. Every rule is static, so all of them are
# accounted against the 2000-rule static budget: keep any rule carrying a `*`
# or a `:placeholder` below the static ones, or the engine bills the remainder
# against the 100-rule dynamic budget and stops reading the file at rule 101.
